<title>SPAIN: Spain's Melia to pay gross dividend 42 pta/share.</title>
<headline>Spain's Melia to pay gross dividend 42 pta/share.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hotel group Sol Melia said on Monday it would pay a gross dividend of 42 pesetas per share on July 7.</p>
<p>In a statement Sol Melia added that this dividend was approved at the general shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom, + 341 5858.340</p>
</text>
